  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evidence, Evaluation, Audit and Learning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to identify areas where evidence and evaluation is lacking, generate new evidence including by maximising and collating learning by partners, and strengthen audit functions when needed.  It will generate learning and evidence to inform the effectiveness and value for money of implementing resilience interventions alongside humanitarian interventions in areas of high humanitarian need.</narrative>
  </description>
